WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.838
Developers build the code.

3
00:00:02.838 --> 00:00:07.312
Server and directory engineers run
the write path and change the hosts.

4
00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:12.248
Application owners name who owns each
service principal name and when it ends,

5
00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:15.362
and the security officer
reviews the island list.

6
00:00:15.362 --> 00:00:17.663
The rights split is the important part.

7
00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:21.160
The read task holds no domain
administration at all,

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.575
just a narrow delegated read
of the root key's dates.

9
00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:27.447
The write task does need
administrator rights,

10
00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:31.497
because Learn's procedure requires
them, and that's exactly why it's

11
00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:35.450
a separate script, run by a person,
on a plan someone else approved.
